--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Algorithmic references
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The synthetic data generator implements an adaptation of the DPSDG
(Differentially-Private Synthetic Data Generation) algorithm described in:

  Liu, X., et al. (2024). SynQB: Enabling Differentially-Private Synthetic
  Data Generation for Query Benchmarking. Meta Platforms.

The differential privacy foundations follow:

  Dwork, C., & Roth, A. (2014). The algorithmic foundations of differential
  privacy. Foundations and Trends in Theoretical Computer Science, 9(3-4),
  211-407.
